                                    <h1>Book a Jewelry D2C Strategy Call &amp;mdash; Free 30-Min Audit (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>Ready to talk to us about your jewelry brand? This page explains what to expect from our free 30-minute discovery call, what to prepare, what we deliver post-call, and how our engagement process works from first call to signed contract.</p><p>No sales pitch. No pressure. We walk away from engagements that are not a fit + tell you honestly if a different agency + tier + envelope suits your brand better.</p>
                                    <h2>What the free 30-min discovery call covers</h2>
                                    <p>The call is a 30-minute video meeting (Calendly-scheduled + Google Meet or Zoom link) between:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Your side:</strong> Founder + co-founder + marketing lead (whoever will own the marketing relationship).</li><li><strong>Our side:</strong> Prashant Chaudhari (founder + business head) + senior jewelry-vertical strategist. Both on the call, not sales staff.</li></ul><p><strong>What we cover in 30 minutes:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Your brand + product + collection + sub-vertical positioning (5 min)</li><li>Current funnel + Shopify + traffic + revenue + attribution (5 min)</li><li>Marketing history + past agency experience + what worked / didn't (5 min)</li><li>Growth goals + 12-24 month revenue target + geography ambition (5 min)</li><li>Team + capital + runway + timeline (5 min)</li><li>Q&A + immediate feedback + next steps (5 min)</li></ul>
                                    <h2>What to prepare before the call</h2>
                                    <p>15-20 minutes of prep before the call maximises value:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Website + Shopify URL:</strong> So we can inspect Shopify build + apps + product pages + landing pages + checkout.</li><li><strong>Instagram + Meta Ads Library links:</strong> So we can see brand voice + creative + past ads.</li><li><strong>Current revenue + traffic + CPL data (if available):</strong> Monthly revenue, monthly Meta + Google spend + CPL, monthly organic traffic. Ballpark numbers OK if exact unavailable.</li><li><strong>Sub-vertical positioning + collection:</strong> Fashion / fine / bridal / lab-grown / men's / regional-heritage. AOV band + primary buyer persona.</li><li><strong>Growth goals:</strong> Realistic 12-month + 24-month monthly revenue target. Geography (India-only / India + GCC / multi-region).</li><li><strong>Timeline + starting budget:</strong> When do you want to start + realistic month-1 investment envelope (retainer + ad spend + one-time).</li><li><strong>Team + capital context:</strong> Founder solo / small team / VC-backed / bootstrapped. Runway (6 / 12 / 18 / 24 months).</li></ul>
                                    <h2>What we deliver post-call (within 3 business days)</h2>
                                    <p>Post-call within 3 business days, you receive a customised proposal:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Diagnostic summary:</strong> Our read on your current position + funnel + brand + Shopify + attribution + gaps + opportunities.</li><li><strong>Recommended engagement tier:</strong> Starter / Growth / Enterprise + why fit your brand.</li><li><strong>90-day plan:</strong> Month-1 + Month-2 + Month-3 deliverables + priorities + expected outcomes.</li><li><strong>Budget breakdown:</strong> Retainer + ad spend + one-time + tooling itemised. No bundled markup.</li><li><strong>KPIs + reporting:</strong> Weekly + monthly + quarterly + milestone-based accountability.</li><li><strong>Team:</strong> Named team members + roles + founder-strategist involvement.</li><li><strong>Timeline:</strong> Onboarding + kick-off + first-launch + phased rollout.</li><li><strong>Contract terms summary:</strong> 6-month MSA + month-to-month cancellation after month 3 + ad-spend transparent pass-through + IP + platform-access ownership.</li></ul><p>Proposal is free + non-committal. Use it to evaluate against 2-4 alternative agency proposals + choose based on fit + evidence + transparency.</p>
                                    <h2>What happens if you decide to move forward</h2>
                                    <p>Standard onboarding path:</p><ol style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Contract negotiation (1-2 weeks):</strong> MSA + SOW review + legal review + redline + signature.</li><li><strong>Kick-off + onboarding (Week 1):</strong> Access setup (Shopify + Meta Business Manager + Google Ads + WhatsApp Business + CRM) + team introductions + Slack channel setup + document handover.</li><li><strong>Phase 1 Discovery (Week 2-3):</strong> Deep audit + brand + funnel + creative + attribution + tooling + team. 30-page growth diagnostic document.</li><li><strong>Phase 2 Foundation (Week 4-6):</strong> Shopify + apps + WhatsApp + Meta + Google + Instagram + Pinterest setup + attribution + reporting foundation.</li><li><strong>Phase 3 Launch (Week 7-8):</strong> First campaigns live + creative + content launch + WhatsApp funnel + reporting cadence established.</li><li><strong>Phase 4 Optimise (Month 3+):</strong> Weekly optimisation + monthly QBR + creative refresh + campaign expansion.</li><li><strong>Phase 5 Scale (Month 6+):</strong> Multi-region + multi-channel + PR + celebrity + video + retention programmes.</li></ol>
                                    <h2>Book the call now &amp;mdash; direct Calendly + WhatsApp</h2>
                                    <p>Two ways to reach us:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Direct Calendly booking:</strong> <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs/30min</a>. Select a 30-min slot Mon-Sat 9am-6pm IST. Auto-detects your timezone (works for GCC + international).</li><li><strong>WhatsApp direct:</strong> Message us on <a href="https://wa.me/919xxxxxxxxx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 9XXX XXX XXX</a> with your brand name + website URL + brief intro. We respond within 4 business hours.</li><li><strong>Founder direct:</strong> Prashant's LinkedIn: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/prashantchaudhari" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin.com/in/prashantchaudhari</a>. DM for founder-to-founder direct.</li><li><strong>Contact form:</strong> <a href="/contact.php">/contact.php</a>. Standard business enquiry.</li></ul><p>Free + non-committal. No sales pressure. We're responsive + honest about fit.</p>

